abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 companion accompanying Models for dagger (infinity,1)-categories I:
  Dagger simplicial sets and unitary cores, developed with AI assistance.
  The saved local ARM64 Linux validation covers 2771 modules, 40022 owned
  declarations, 71 advertised results, eight main roots, nine B/C/D cases,
  five A cases, and four rejected axiom-audit controls, with a byte-identical
  restored audit. It continued from a partial cache and was not a cold rebuild
  or a fresh integrated-controller execution. A hosted-CI pass and independent
  human manuscript review are not claimed. The accompanying English catalogue
  has AI-generated prose and uses the notation of Part I.
  Apache-2.0 covers original companion code and documentation; copied sources
  retain their own terms. The repository-wide license scope of some upstream
  copies remains unconfirmed, as recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
